  <entity00401731:DescriptionOfTheTransferredBusinessOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfTheTransferredBusinessOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfTheTransferredBusinessTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">로봇 사업 부문의 양도
회사는 2025년 5월 14일에 로봇 사업 부문을 ㈜베어로보틱스코리아에 양도하였습니다.</entity00401731:DescriptionOfTheTransferredBusinessOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfTheTransferredBusinessOfDisclosureOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfTheTransferredBusinessTableOfItems>
