  <ifrs-full:InformationAboutNatureOfLessorsLeasingActivities contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 연결회사는 가전렌탈사업 및 부동산임대와 관련하여 해지불능 운용리스계약을 체결하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:InformationAboutNatureOfLessorsLeasingActivities>
  <dart:NameOfTheInstitutionMakingTheCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00401731_LoanCommitments3OfLoanCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">신한은행 등</dart:NameOfTheInstitutionMakingTheCommitments>
  <dart:NameOfTheInstitutionMakingTheCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00401731_LoanCommitments2OfLoanCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">신한은행 등 다수의 금융기관</dart:NameOfTheInstitutionMakingTheCommitments>
  <dart:NameOfTheInstitutionMakingTheCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00401731_LoanCommitments1OfLoanCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">신한은행 등 다수의 금융기관</dart:NameOfTheInstitutionMakingTheCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00401731_ContractualCommitmentsForAcquisitionOfAssetsOfPurchaseCommitmentMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 발생하지 아니한 자산의 취득을 위한 약정액은 다음과 같습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00401731_LoanCommitments3OfLoanCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 연결회사는 신한은행 등과 기업어음약정 40,000백만원을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <ifrs-full:IndicationOfUncertaintiesOfAmountOrTimingOfOutflowsContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity00401731_LgDisplayCoLtdOfDefendantInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">동 결과에 따라 연결회사의 지분법손익은 영향을 받을 수 있습니다. 상기 피소된 소송 및 진행중인 조사와 관련하여 연결회사가 개별적으로 책임을 부담하지는 않습니다.</ifrs-full:IndicationOfUncertaintiesOfAmountOrTimingOfOutflowsContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:IndicationOfUncertaintiesOfAmountOrTimingOfOutflowsContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity00401731_LgElectronicsIncOfDefendantInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">동 소송 등의 최종 결과 및 영향은 합리적으로 예측할 수 없으며, 연결회사의 경영진은 연결회사의 재무상태에 중요한 영향을 미치지 않을 것으로 판단하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:IndicationOfUncertaintiesOfAmountOrTimingOfOutflowsContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity00401731_LgDisplayCoLtdOfDefendantInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">또한, 보고기간말 현재 연결회사의 관계기업인 엘지디스플레이㈜는 여러 건의 특허관련 소송에 피소된 상태이며, 담합혐의에 대한 관계기관의 조사 및 민사 소송이 진행되고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_ClassesofLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityAxis_entity00401731_LgElectronicsIncOfDefendantInLawsuitsMemberOfDisclosureOfLegalProceedingsContingentLiabilityTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 연결회사의 정상적인 영업과정에서 발생한 다수의 소송, 분쟁 및 규제기관 조사 등이 진행 중에 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <entity00401731:LimitAmountOfProvisionOfGuaranteesByToEntityUsdOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025eHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00401731_PaymentGuaranteeForSecuredPrivateBondsMemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" unitRef="USD" decimals="-6">50000000</entity00401731:LimitAmountOfProvisionOfGuaranteesByToEntityUsdOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPfLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfItems>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00401731_PaymentGuaranteeForSecuredPrivateBondsMemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">엘지이노텍㈜은 신한은행으로부터 보증부 사모사채의 원금 US$ 50백만(2024년 말: US$ 50백만) 및 이자에 대해 지급보증을 제공받고 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
